# Campus kit publish

The user designs campus meshes in Blender. The user must not enable add-ons, sync node groups, or run Blender CLI.

When the user wants those edits in the game, save the blend if Blender is open, then run `scripts/export-campus-kit.sh` on macOS or `scripts/export-campus-kit.ps1` on Windows. Run Blender outside the sandbox. Require `PIPELINE_EXPORT_SUCCESS`. Do not hand-edit `game/assets/generated`.

When the user wants to open the kit, run `scripts/open-campus-kit.sh` or `scripts/open-campus-kit.ps1`.
